---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Editorial Corrections & Updates Policy | OraeSkin"
    description="OraeSkin's editorial corrections policy. Learn how we verify pricing, track formulation changes, and update articles when errors or product changes are reported."
>
    <Header />
    <main style="padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 90px;">
        <article class="container corrections-article">
            <header class="corrections-header">
                <span class="eyebrow">Editorial Integrity</span>
                <h1>Corrections & Product Updates Policy</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Skincare formulations, marketplace pricing, and scientific consensus evolve. Here is our policy on keeping our research accurate and transparent.</p>
                <p class="last-updated">Policy Effective: September 2026</p>
            </header>

            <div class="corrections-body">
                <!-- Highlight box -->
                <div class="highlight-callout">
                    <h3>Our Commitment to Factual Accuracy</h3>
                    <p>
                        We strive for meticulous accuracy across our product databases, ingredient breakdowns, and buying guides. When an error is identified — whether factual, scientific, or relating to product availability — we correct it promptly and transparently.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Section 1: Types of Corrections -->
                <h2>1. Types of Updates We Handle</h2>

                <div class="update-types-grid">
                    <div class="update-type-card">
                        <h4>🔄 Formulation Changes & Reformulations</h4>
                        <p>Skincare manufacturers periodically adjust preservative systems, fragrances, or active concentrations. When a brand reformulates an existing SKU, we re-evaluate the full INCI list, recalculate the OraeSkin Score, and update our recommendation.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="update-type-card">
                        <h4>🏷️ Price & Stock Adjustments</h4>
                        <p>Prices on Amazon India fluctuate due to lightning deals, festivals (e.g. Great Indian Festival), and merchant changes. Every product page lists an estimated price and the date of last verification. When stock becomes unavailable, we flag it as "Currently Unavailable" rather than fabricating pricing.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="update-type-card">
                        <h4>🔬 Scientific & Evidentiary Updates</h4>
                        <p>Cosmetic dermatology evolves. If new peer-reviewed studies or regulatory decisions (such as European SCCS or Indian CDSCO guidance on UV filters or preservatives) emerge, we update our ingredient guides accordingly.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="update-type-card">
                        <h4>✍️ Typographical & Factual Corrections</h4>
                        <p>Errors in bottle volume, packaging type, or active percentages are corrected as soon as verified.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Section 2: Timestamp Transparency -->
                <h2>2. Timestamp & Audit Transparency</h2>
                <p>
                    To prevent misleading consumers, our product review pages and buying guides feature explicit verification markers:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Last Editorial Review:</strong> Indicates the date an editor reviewed the formulation, claims, and alternatives.</li>
                    <li><strong>Price Checked Date:</strong> Indicates the most recent verification of Amazon India pricing and in-stock status.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    We never dynamically generate fake "Updated Today" timestamps simply to trick search engines or users.
                </p>

                <!-- Section 3: How to Report an Error -->
                <h2>3. How to Report an Inaccuracy</h2>
                <p>
                    We actively encourage readers, cosmetic formulators, and dermatologists to flag discrepancies. If you notice an outdated price, a discontinued product, or an inaccurate ingredient listing, please report it to us:
                </p>
                <div class="report-box">
                    <h4>Submit a Correction Request</h4>
                    <p>When contacting us, please include:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>The URL of the OraeSkin page with the inaccuracy</li>
                        <li>The specific product name or sentence requiring correction</li>
                        <li>Supporting evidence (e.g., photo of new product packaging, batch INCI list, or official manufacturer link)</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="contact-info">
                        Direct Email: <strong>editorial@oraeskin.in</strong> (or via our <a href="/about/">About Page</a>)
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Section 4: Resolution Timeframe -->
                <h2>4. Correction Protocol & Review Timeframe</h2>
                <p>
                    Our editorial team reviews all correction submissions within 48 to 72 business hours. If a substantive error is verified:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>The page content and database record are immediately updated.</li>
                    <li>For significant changes (such as an altered active percentage or score change), a visible revision note is appended to the bottom of the article.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
    .corrections-article {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .corrections-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #c87a54;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .corrections-header h1 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 2.8rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: #666;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto 12px auto;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .corrections-body {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #3e3e3e;
    }

    .corrections-body h2 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
        margin-top: 46px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #f4ede4;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .highlight-callout {
        background: #fdfaf6;
        border: 1px solid #ebd9cb;
        border-left: 5px solid #c87a54;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px 28px;
        margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .highlight-callout h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
    }

    .highlight-callout p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #4a4a4a;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .update-types-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 24px 0 36px 0;
    }

    .update-type-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #eee5dd;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    }

    .update-type-card h4 {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
    }

    .update-type-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .report-box {
        background: #faf7f2;
        border: 1px solid #e8ded4;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 26px;
        margin: 24px 0;
    }

    .report-box h4 {
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
    }

    .report-box ol {
        padding-left: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .report-box li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: #4a4a4a;
    }

    .contact-info {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px dashed #c87a54;
        margin: 0;
        color: #2c2c2c;
    }

    .contact-info a {
        color: #c87a54;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .corrections-header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }
    }
</style>
